  m_text: "WELCOME!\n\nThis section of the game is rhythm based. Space Guy's side
    is on the left, and Space Dog's is on the right! To press Space Guy's button
    press A (keyboard) or left trigger (controller). For Space Dogs's button, press
    D (keyboard) or right trigger (controller).\n\nBEWARE!\nThis level contains bombs
    that will explode and make it GAME OVER if you don't press spacebar (keyboard)\n  
    or the south button on your game pad/\n       controller before it reaches the
    end!"
